Skua's fix module is an independent Go implementation of link recognition,
provider adapters, Discord Components V2 rendering and message lifecycle handling.
It uses the maintained services below. No FixEmbed Python or TypeScript source is
copied into Skua and there is no runtime execution or vendoring of upstream code.

